# GoRent.ng product

Nigerian rental marketplace. **Homes and item rentals are equal** (apartments, flats, rooms — and generators, tools, appliances). One profile, many roles — never separate accounts. Do not promise zero agency fees.

## Always true

- Homes and items share homepage, nav, and hierarchy. Use a visible Homes / Items toggle — never hide either.
- No agency-fee banners, “no agents” guarantees, or “report a fee” chrome. `/report` is a generic listing-problem form.
- Reviews only after a real `tenancy` or a **completed** `item_booking`.
- Naira via `formatNaira`. Mobile-first, `next/image`, semantic HTML, alt text.
- Roles are a set (`landlord` | `tenant` | `lender` | `renter`), not a single enum.

```txt
❌ Separate /landlord-login vs /tenant-login accounts
✅ One /login; roles accrue from activity
❌ Housing-first homepage that treats items as an afterthought
✅ Equal weight for homes and items
```
